# Auto-push to GitHub

When the user asks for app/API changes in this project, after the work is done:

1. Commit the relevant files (never `.env`, credentials, or secrets).
2. Push `main` to `https://github.com/ravi1927/milk_delivery.git`.

Do not wait for a second "please push" unless the push fails (auth, conflict). Then report the GitHub URL.
